  "notes": "## 0.14.1-alpha.1 - 2026-06-10\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix the Windows portable zip missing `uniclipd.exe`, which made the v0.14.0 portable build unable to start\n- Stop the background helper (`uniclipd`) from flashing a console window on Windows (#1012)\n- Fix the upgrade notice being re-detected on every launch by advancing the version cursor for known upgrades (#1012)\n\n### Improvements\n\n- Capture update install/download outcomes in local logs so a failing auto-update can be diagnosed, even with telemetry off (#1012)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.14.1-alpha.1 - 2026-06-10\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Windows 便携版 zip 缺少 `uniclipd.exe` 导致 v0.14.0 便携版完全无法启动的问题\n- 修复 Windows 上后台助手（`uniclipd`）闪出控制台窗口的问题 (#1012)\n- 修复每次启动都重复检测到升级的问题：已知版本升级现在会正确推进版本游标 (#1012)\n\n### Improvements\n\n- 更新下载/安装结果现在会记录到本地日志，即使关闭遥测也能排查自动更新失败的原因 (#1012)",
